  "composer": {
    "accepted_prose": "Tomi leans forward, tapping a quick rhythm against her thigh. “One trial, stopwatch only. I need time to first touch, how long I hold the stance before it breaks, and whether I manage a clean disengage. That’s it.” Her tone stays fast but serious. “No standing permission past that. I’ll decide what happens next after I see the numbers.”\n\nAoi smooths the cuff of her sleeve before answering. “The hallway timing is fine as long as it doesn’t block the bathroom door. For the back entrance, just leave a note if you’re stepping out so no one double-locks it by mistake.” Her smile stays light and unreadable, but her attention doesn’t drift toward Tomi at all. “Nothing else needs coordinating on my side.”",
